Output docs/assets/scenes/relationship-demo.mp4

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 8
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "uv run python docs/demo/demo.py --scene relationships"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Show
Type "/"
Type "payment-worker"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "g"
Sleep 5s
Hide
Type "q"
